{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Logo_KN_EN_Desc.png?t=1745383389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a meatball restaurant in this high energy comedic cooking game. Meet quirky locals and cook their wild orders, upgrade and customize your restaurant, win thrilling cooking battles, and become the town\u2019s top eatery!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Desc_01.png?t=1745383389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve just inherited your grandma\u2019s once-famous meatball restaurant in the cozy town of KuloNiku. Now it\u2019s up to you to bring it back to glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on eccentric orders from townsfolk, serve up delicious meals, and restore your family\u2019s legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware\u2014there\u2019s fierce competition from the town\u2019s flashiest rival: Starstruck Diner, run by the menacing rockstar chef, Stella.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Cook_01.gif?t=1745383389\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Desc_02.png?t=1745383389\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to sizzle, slice, and skewer! Cook juicy meatballs, crisp veggies, and other delicious ingredients in your very own kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chop, boil, fry, torch, and more with immersive, tactile controls that make every action satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And hey\u2014want to add an extra punch of garlic or a sprinkle of salt? Go for it. You\u2019re the chef!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Desc_03.png?t=1745383389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Cook_02.gif?t=1745383389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These townsfolk just can't wait to dine at your fine establishment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The locals can\u2019t wait to try your food\u2014and each one has their own look, personality, and palate. Listen closely to their quirky orders, cook fast and accurately, and rack up those juicy tips! \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But your customers aren\u2019t just customers. Some may become your allies, rivals, or even part of your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your friends close\u2014and your customers closer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Desc_04.png?t=1745383389\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/decoration_kuloniku.gif?t=1745383389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep things fresh! Unlock new tools, buy better ingredients, and discover brand-new recipes to keep your menu exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also personalize your restaurant with fun decorations in various styles. But decor isn\u2019t just cosmetic\u2014some items give gameplay perks like extra tips or more patient customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Style and substance? Yes, chef!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Desc_05.png?t=1745383389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rival chefs want to take over your restaurant\u2014and there\u2019s only one way to settle things: Meatball Brawls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In these thrilling culinary duels, you\u2019ll go head-to-head to impress the judges. It\u2019s not just about speed\u2014it\u2019s about strategy, creativity, and mastering every step of the cooking process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes? Show them who the real top chef is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Contest_Gif.gif?t=1745383389\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357960?t=1745383389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/180a44930435aa6b5a2b901d903c91121500bcfd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745383389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/851dbd4c5179002e67159077e9973a2d1f928e65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745383389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/851dbd4c5179002e67159077e9973a2d1f928e65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745383389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357960/extras/Logo_KN_EN_Desc.png?t=1745383389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a meatball restaurant in th